    <string name="cpu_intro">Core status, cluster clocks and manual governor selection.</string>
    <string name="cpu_online">Online cores</string>
    <string name="cpu_policy_note">Frequency limits are managed by the ROM. Online cores are available to Android; this does not mean they are all busy.</string>
    <string name="cpu_control_note">Choose a supported governor for each cluster. Changes are verified and originals are kept for Restore. Butterd does not reapply changes at boot.</string>
