    <string name="record_share">Share recording</string>
    <string name="record_intro">Record battery power, temperatures, USB readings, charging commands and CPU state. Root adds readings only after you grant it.</string>
    <string name="record_privacy">Recordings stay on this phone until you choose to share. They contain device model, software versions and sensor readings, but no account information, serial number, IMEI or app list. Maximum 30 minutes or 2 MB. The latest two sessions are kept. A live notification is required; stopping it ends recording. Stopping recording leaves the live monitor on until you turn it off.</string>
