    <string name="bypass_test_title">CHECKING ROM BYPASS</string>
    <string name="bypass_test_steps">Start recording before changing anything. In XiaomiParts, reproduce your normal lower-power selection and bypass toggle. Add a marker after each change, then return here, stop recording and share the file. Butterd observes this test; it does not alter charging.</string>
